[[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Prise up and remove the right differential shaft oil seal.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care not to damage the oil seal seal during its removal.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194000775.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Lubricate a new right differential shaft oil seal using transmission fluid.</p><p>1. Fit the right differential seal new oil seal (1a) in its housing using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><p>Tool</p></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th><th><p>Validity</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1870100002</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td><p>Fitting differential left/right shaft oil seal</p></td><td><p>2.2</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194000776.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[12,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Prise up and remove the right differential shaft oil seal.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care not to damage the oil seal seat during its removal.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194003863.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[12,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Lubricate a new right differential shaft oil seal using transmission fluid.</p><p>- Place the new differential right shaft oil seal in its housing.</p>"]]